  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Ditrichum in Moss Flora of China @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=4\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-4.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Moss Flora of China home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='4' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\">Moss China V. 1 Page 69</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Moss China</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='volume_page.aspx?volume_id=4001&flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' >Moss China V. 1</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=10286'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=4&start_taxon_id=10286'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n5. <b>Ditrichum</b> Hampe, Flora.  50: 181.  1867.  \n<p>牛毛藓属  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nPlants often minute to small, rarely medium-sized or large, yellowish green, in loose or dense tufts. Stems erect, simple or sparsely branched, sparsely to densely radiculose; central strand present. Leaves often homomallous, lanceolate, gradually or abruptly narrowed from a lanceolate or oblong-ovate, sometimes clasping base to a long, slender or setaceous acumen; margins plane or reflexed, entire or serrulate above; costa single, stout, percurrent to excurrent, usually filling most or nearly the entire subula; upper cells subquadrate to oval or elongate, smooth; basal cells rectangular to linear, thin-walled; alar cells not differentiated. Autoicous or dioicous. Perichaetial leaves similar to the upper stem leaves or slightly larger and clasping at base. Setae elongate, slender, straight or flexuous; capsules oblong-ovoid to cylindric, erect to suberect or inclined, symmetric or curved, sometimes striate or furrowed when dry and empty; opercula conic, or shortly rostrate; annuli differentiated, consisting of large cells, revoluble, deciduous or persistent; stomata present; peristome single, 16 teeth, linear or filiform, divided nearly to the base, basal membrane low, papillose. Calyptrae cucullate, smooth, entire. Spores spherical, small, smooth or faintly papillose.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nThe genus consists of about 50 species in the world.  Redfearn et al. (1996) listed 13 species of Ditrichum from China. Of these 13 species, Ditrichum microcarpum Broth. and D. setschwanicum Broth. are synonyms of D. pusillum (Hedw.) Hampe (T. Cao 1994). Ditrichum darjeelingense Ren. & Card. and D. tortuloides Grout reported from Yunnan by S.-Y. Zeng (1990) and D. divaricatum Mitt. listed by Redfearn et al. (1996) cannot be confirmed. In this study, eight species are treated for China.\r\n<p>\r\nThe gametophytes of several Ditrichum species are similar to those of Dicranella and Pleuridium, but the threadlike division and papillose markings of the peristome teeth are significantly different from Dicranella, and its stegocarpous sporophyte condition affirms the difference from Pleuridium.<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Stems usually more than 1.5 cm high, loosely foliate; leaves clearly contorted above the middle</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Stems usually not more than 1.0 cm high, densely foliate; leaves erect above the middle</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-2'>2</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Autoicous; leaf shoulder cells linear, 4-8 times as long as wide; capsules inclined, asymmetric</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>3 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000863'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum difficile</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Dioicous; leaf shoulder cells quadrate or oblong-hexagonal, 1-3 times as long as wide; capsules erect, symmetric</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-3'>3</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants slender, in short tufts, 2-3 cm high; leaves 2-3 mm long, oblong-ovate at base; leaf shoulder cells about   1-1.5 times as long as wide</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>4 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000865'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum flexicaule</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants rather robust, in tall tufts, 4-14 cm high; leaves 4-8 mm long, lanceolate at base; leaf shoulder cells 2-3 times as long as wide</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>5 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=240000061'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum gracile</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-4'>4</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsules inclined, asymmetric</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsules erect, symmetric</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-7'>(7)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-5'>5</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Dioicous; peristome teeth 80-100 µm long; upper and median leaf cells short-rectangular</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>2 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000862'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum brevidens</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Autoicous; peristome teeth 170-900 µm long; upper and median leaf cells elongate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-6'>(6)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-6'>6</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsules smooth when dry and empty; setae ca. 5 cm long; peristome teeth ca. 170 µm long; spores 12-15 µm, smooth</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=240000060'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum aureum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsules furrowed when dry and empty; setae 2-4(-5) cm long; peristome teeth 400-900 µm long; spores 16-20 µm, papillose</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>7 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000867'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum pallidum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-7'>7</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf margins plane; leaf cells linear; autoicous</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>6 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000866'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum heteromallum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf margins reflexed; leaf cells short-rectanguar; dioicous</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>8 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000868'  TARGET='_top' >Ditrichum pusillum</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=240000060' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>aureum</b>  Bartr.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000862' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>brevidens</b>  Nog.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000863' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>difficile</b>  (Duby) Fleisch.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000865' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>flexicaule</b>  (Schwaegr.) Hampe</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=240000061' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>gracile</b>  (Mitt.) O. Kuntze</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000866' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>heteromallum</b>  (Hedw.) Mitt.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000867' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>pallidum</b>  (Hedw.) Hampe</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=200000868' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ditrichum</b> <b>pusillum</b>  (Hedw.) Hampe</A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        \r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=110696'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=1&taxon_id=110696'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of North America' >Flora of North America</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Ditrichum'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Ditrichum&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Ditrichum'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\"></TD>\r\n\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </TD>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td>\r\n<table id=\"SubHeaderTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#99cc99\" id=\"SubHeaderTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <TD align=\"center\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHome\" href=\"index.aspx\" target=\"_top\">eFlora Home</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkPeopleSearch\" href=\"person_search.aspx\" target=\"_top\">People Search</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHelp\" href=\"help_page.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Help</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkActKey\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/ActKey\" target=\"_top\">ActKey</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink2\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/HuCards/\" target=\"_top\">Hu Cards</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink1\" href=\"glossary.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Glossary</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n          </TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </TABLE>\r\n  <a href=\"/url.html\" style='display:none'>login</a></body>\r\n</HTML>\r\n"
